;; Active generated DOTOS output manifest for skill generation.
;; This file lists active outputs only; absence means inactive.
;; Skill fields: output id, module id, category, tier, target surfaces.
;; Each skill's description lives in its own module source file's leading
;; frontmatter; the generator reads it from there, not from this manifest.
;; Generated roles are the permission-by-depth cross product and live in
;; role-permissions.dotos, role-depths.dotos, and role-descriptions.dotos.
;; Dependency data lives in module-dependencies.dotos; universal role modules live in universal-role-modules.dotos.

[
